WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.034
It's been a tough year

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:03.069 position:59%
for stocks and bonds around the world,

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:05.839
but there's one investment
that really stands out.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:08.975
Private golf club
memberships in Singapore.

00:00:12.946 --> 00:00:15.415
Values for memberships
at clubs like Sentosa

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:19.319
That means for locals,

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:20.987 position:66%
they've got to pay the equivalent of about

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:26.226
For expats like me, it's more like

00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:30.263
There's a couple of
reasons behind the surge.

00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:31.831 position:56%
There's just been a general increase

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:34.167 position:63%
in interest in golf during the pandemic.

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:35.268
But more importantly,

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:36.269
there's been a surge

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:38.838 position:66%
of wealthy foreigners coming to Singapore.

00:00:38.838 --> 00:00:41.808
The long lockdown in China

00:00:41.808 --> 00:00:44.778
made a lot of people want
to come to Singapore.

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:48.782
They really love our
lifestyle, our freedom.

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:50.083
I think most of them are here

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:51.084
doing some business.

00:00:51.084 --> 00:00:52.252
We are quite happy that

00:00:52.252 --> 00:00:54.220
they are coming and investing here.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.355
They buy membership,

00:00:55.355 --> 00:00:58.391
and they're putting a lot
of money in golf lessons,

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:01.094
which is very good for the game.

